221	    /**
222	     * The id of the existing owner this owner possibly duplicates (same last name and postcode, different
223	     * telephone), or {@code null} when {@link #getPossibleDuplicate() possibleDuplicate} is false. When
224	     * several owners match, this is the earliest (lowest id). Computed per request, not persisted.
